:: HuntResidue [noreturn nobr] {"position":"2500,1350","size":"100,100"}
<<if _residue eq 1>>
    <br><<thought>>You come back to your mind one fragment at a time. There's a thread of something on the inside of your wrist, pencil-line dark. You scrub it with the heel of your hand, but it stays put. You decide it's a paper cut; it couldn't be anything else.<</thought>><br>
<<elseif _residue eq 3>>
    <br><<thought>>Three of them in a row now. I can't pretend it's an accident. Khadija once said you'd do for a first hunt; the second was up to the first. You think about how the math is unsure whose side to be on.<</thought>><br>
<<elseif _residue eq 7>>
    <br><<thought>>Seven. You stop counting them one at a time. They've started reading as a pattern your wrist has, not a series of things that happened to it. You roll your sleeve down and take a deep breath.<</thought>><br>
<</if>>
